OL,3,GNEWSASevern Trent Water boss on bills,
OL,4,Aleaks and sewage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of Severn Trent
OL,7,FWater has defended the company's record
OL,8,Fon sewage pollution and rising water
OL,9,Fbills while admitting there is more
OL,10,Fwork to do.
OL,12,FJames Jesic was speaking on BBC Radio
OL,13,FWM's Hot Seat, where he answered
OL,14,Fquestions from listeners about river
OL,15,Fpollution, water supplies, burst pipes
OL,16,Fand the cost of their bills.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
