OL,3,GNEWSASevern Trent Water boss on bills,
OL,4,Aleaks and sewage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive, who took on the
OL,7,Frole in January after 23 years with the
OL,8,Fcompany, said Severn Trent was
OL,9,Finvesting in improvements but
OL,10,Facknowledged customers had reason to
OL,11,Fexpect better.
OL,13,FHere are five key takeaways from the
OL,14,Finterview.
